<title>USA: Henkel, Loctite merger clears review.</title>
<headline>Henkel, Loctite merger clears review.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henkel KGaA said on Thursday that it has received clearance from the German Federal Cartel Office for the pending acquisition of Loctite Corp.</p>
<p>Henkel launched a $1.3 billion tender offer for the 65 percent stake of Loctite, a U.S.-based adhesives maker, that it does not already own.</p>
<p>The tender offer, which amounts to $61 a share, expires December 20, 1996, unless extended, said Henkel, a German chemicals firm.</p>
